The image is of size 32 x N pixels and encoded as a vector of N integers where each value is a row in the image; y=0 is the first value and y=N-1 is the last row. Each row is represented by an integer where MSB represent x=0 and LSB represent x=31.
# PROBLEM DESCRIPTION END

